total-history cost valuation matches the public journal API.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight total-history --accounts '*Assets:Fund*' --format json --valuation cost

========== API ==========

totalHistory({ accounts: ['*Assets:Fund*'], valuation: 'cost' })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.00 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Equity:Opening
P 2024-01-01 FUND 150 SEK
2024-01-01 Buy
  Assets:Fund  10 FUND {100 SEK}
  Equity:Opening  -1000 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "date": "2024-01-01",
    "amount": "1000",
    "commodity": "SEK"
  }
]
